# 文本文件统一入库为 LF，检出时按平台转换（Windows 上仍是 CRLF，不影响 PowerShell 脚本）
* text=auto

# 二进制文件：禁止行尾转换与文本 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary

# 脚本与配置固定行尾，避免跨平台改行噪音
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
